        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2001, Nobe Single Roll Toilet Paper Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Single Post Nobe Toilet Paper Holder is Made with the quality that Deltana is known for.  It is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. The contemporary mount ensures that it would look sleek in any modern decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2001-specifications.gif?v=1704354647\" width=\"523\" height=\"259\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Nobe Toilet Paper Roll Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible to hang in either direction.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2001.pdf?v=1691095351\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
